sition, pose and costume are up to you. Thank you in advance.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/i/events/1495239927998468096?s=20\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1eTlmqneZq4eoO7CBC2KxD83Z0dlHvml2?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@7kuriri/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/67cd1539/uploads/origins/485b27e9-055e-4b14-a023-4756760a310a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f62cc240a7d6cf1ef92c2a99fc76737", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/67cd1539/uploads/origins/485b27e9-055e-4b14-a023-4756760a310a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f62cc240a7d6cf1ef92c2a99fc76737, https://si.imgix.net/67cd1539/uploads/origins/485b27e9-055e-4b14-a023-4756760a310a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c5b9274abab54a2ea24ad8e91d3c031 2x, https://si.imgix.net/67cd1539/uploads/origins/485b27e9-055e-4b14-a023-4756760a310a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac9827b9e7d9ac0733e2a828f3ccbdf8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Could you draw my friend and I. Love your style so I'd leave it up to you on what you would want to do. We are both really close and love to make jokes.\n\nTatsu is - Playful, competitive, and Smug\nSkylar is - Shy, Easily Flustered, and cat like\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1R4vLPW4wpW7bfIE37CKxzVxWZ1CVcEWw?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@7kuriri/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5487888c/uploads/origins/4d0d0dac-887d-4d02-b7fa-ba1221c91dff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb563c9009d2e30edc37203709d88006", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5487888c/uploads/origins/4d0d0dac-887d-4d02-b7fa-ba1221c91dff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb563c9009d2e30edc37203709d88006, https://si.imgix.net/5487888c/uploads/origins/4d0d0dac-887d-4d02-b7fa-ba1221c91dff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=85ac26af61796534f49f73757b785ae7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5487888c/uploads/origins/4d0d0dac-887d-4d02-b7fa-ba1221c91dff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a933307499f73ef1cfa7fee9b377bbe 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "This is a first time request.\n\nGod's Second Life\nhttps://yamanosu.com/blog-entry-188.html\nof a work called\n\nI would like to ask for an illustration of the character Hitotsume.\n\nFor reference\nCover of episode 22\nhttps://yamanosu.com/blog-entry-261.html\n\nAn image of a craftswoman, covered in soot and hard at work.\n\nI would be happy if you could draw a good sweat and a smile based on the\n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://yamanosu.com/blog-entry-261.html", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@7kuriri/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a8d7272f/uploads/origins/d8a512dc-633d-4189-beca-8b6775831dcf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c43b340a423d54ec595d1222adfce9c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a8d7272f/uploads/origins/d8a512dc-633d-4189-beca-8b6775831dcf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c43b340a423d54ec595d1222adfce9c, https://si.imgix.net/a8d7272f/uploads/origins/d8a512dc-633d-4189-beca-8b6775831dcf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5265e42d93f62e3f7384fca51d2fff42 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a8d7272f/uploads/origins/d8a512dc-633d-4189-beca-8b6775831dcf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dbb40a74939d426f8f06473647ff052e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi,\nI would like to know if you draw men too? I would really like you to take care of my avatar. He is a son of the sun, he has a certain warm and captivating aura and loves warm colors. I will let you do as you prefer for the position of the character, so you have a good time!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/WiwiTV_/status/1538465474614280193", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@7kuriri/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/270f1e66/uploads/origins/3aed13c0-0fd7-4337-86af-fe0af8661c7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=64decf525698a237a8c72e9f0faa8f23", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/270f1e66/uploads/origins/3aed13c0-0fd7-4337-86af-fe0af8661c7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=64decf525698a237a8c72e9f0faa8f23, https://si.imgix.net/270f1e66/uploads/origins/3aed13c0-0fd7-4337-86af-fe0af8661c7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8b08a42bb511fc57b7127c79fb1a7920 2x, https://si.imgix.net/270f1e66/uploads/origins/3aed13c0-0fd7-4337-86af-fe0af8661c7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ad929ef0d5e941e8456003c2810bdf0e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@7kuriri/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/94256954/uploads/origins/6922f3da-903c-4315-8ea7-5ca7fa850d43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d59cf698b47997f909b88390b7292eb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/94256954/uploads/origins/6922f3da-903c-4315-8ea7-5ca7fa850d43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d59cf698b47997f909b88390b7292eb, https://si.imgix.net/94256954/uploads/origins/692